Explo-RS is a Rust rewrite of the behaviour of Explo (https://github.com/LumePart/Explo, MIT)
as extended by Explo-Enhanced (https://github.com/leoric/ExploEnhanced). The track-matching
score and the title/tag clean-up rules are ported from that code.

At run time it uses, as external programs: yt-dlp (Unlicense), FFmpeg (LGPL/GPL).
The YouTube Music search request format follows ytmusicapi (https://github.com/sigma67/ytmusicapi, MIT).
